## Implementation

- `packages/read-along/components/read-along/read-along-passage.tsx`: `aria-current` on the current sentence and the marked word; `data-word`; one sentence tab stop; words at `tabindex="-1"` with Left and Right arrow focus and Enter or Space tap.
- `packages/read-along/components/read-along/read-along-player.tsx`: the duplicate `playPauseButton` id is removed.
- `apps/storytime/app/[locale]/st/[level]/[week]/reader.tsx` (new): the client reader with the page turner, the horizontal swipe, "read it to me", "my turn", the slow recording at playback rate 1, the word cut from 30 ms before the start, the page-end stop, the end view, and the localized audio error.
